WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.880
Lo siento, Gina.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.200
Just to clarify.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.920
Don't get me wrong, brother.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.880
I'm looking out for you here.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.640
You just can't

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.680
keep shooting

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.280
blanks forever.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.680
I'm sorry.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.520
But trust me, I know

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.800
what I'm talking about.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.800
Henry, do you also use

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.960
a rifle with a laser sight?

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.400
It sounds like an accusation.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.920
Don't dodge the questions.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.200
Just answer about

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.480
the fucking rifle.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.480
Enough!

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.480
Let Gina speak.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.840
Is it true,

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.000
that you can't have children?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.600
Yes.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.120
It is true.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.600
I'm infertile.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:50.920
I trust this stack of

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.040
medical reports over

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.240
a single examination,

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.000
even from Dr. Ramirez.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.600
Unfortunately, so do I.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:00:59.440
Great.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.560
Well, I'm...  sorry.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.400
I'd better go.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:07.880
Gina, wait.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.120
Stay here, Walt.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.520
I have an important announcement

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.120
to share with all of you.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.400
I am retiring,

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.640
And I will announce my successor.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:33.440
An hour ago, I had a

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.680
different plan, but now

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:36.320
everything has changed.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:38.320
Henry.
